; NEGATIVE CONTROL for the ERAN auto-tester.
; The first attempt spawned at 0,0,0 -- which is Nachalat Binyamin, a STREET -- reported
; clean, and I nearly accepted it as proof the detector worked. Third correction. (0,-44) is a block centre, but at y=4 he stands UNDER the building --
; the ground floor is open pilotis, which is the whole point of the style. y=9 is inside
; the mass itself. If BURIED does not fire at y=9, the detector really is broken.
; If BURIED does not fire here, every "clean" report from the tester is worthless.
